      "content": "idk if i want to rebuild. everything feels so heavy and pointless. it feels like i'm just stuck in this middle place where i'm not really living but i'm not not living either. sometimes i think it would just be easier if i wasn't here. if i could just go back to how things were, or just... not have to carry this emptiness anymore. does that make sense? that it feels like the only way to find peace is to just stop?",
